	<element name="Vanish" type="Class Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_CLASS_FEATURE_RANGER_VANISH">
		<description><p>You can use the Hide action as a bonus action on your turn. Also, you can’t be tracked by nonmagical means unless you choose to leave a trail.</p></description>
	</element>

