	<element name="Evasion" type="Archetype Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_HUNTER_OPTION_EVASION">
		<supports>Superior Hunter’s Defense</supports>
		<description><p>When you are subjected to an effect that allows a Dexterity saving throw for half damage, you take no damage on a success and only half damage on a failure.</p></description>
		<sheet><description>When you are subjected to an effect that allows a Dexterity saving throw for half damage, you take no damage on a success and only half damage on a failure.</description></sheet>
	</element>

	<element name="Stand Against the Tide" type="Archetype Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_HUNTER_OPTION_STAND_AGAINST_THE_TIDE">
		<supports>Superior Hunter’s Defense</supports>
		<description><p>When a hostile creature misses you with a melee attack, you can use your reaction to force it to repeat the attack against another creature of your choice.</p></description>
		<sheet><description>When a hostile creature misses you with a melee attack, you can use your reaction to force it to repeat the attack against another creature of your choice.</description></sheet>
	</element>

	<element name="Uncanny Dodge" type="Archetype Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_HUNTER_OPTION_UNCANNY_DODGE">
		<supports>Superior Hunter’s Defense</supports>
		<description><p>When an attacker you can see hits you with an attack, you can use your reaction to halve the attack’s damage against you.</p></description>
